  "releaseNotes": "NextGenSoftware.OASIS.API.Providers.MonadOASIS v2.0.5\n\nConnects the OASIS to Monad — a high-performance EVM-compatible L1 with 10,000+ TPS via parallel execution and MonadBFT consensus (chain ID 143). Stores OASIS holons, avatars, and NFTs on Monad Mainnet. Part of the OASIS HOT-Swappable Provider Architecture.\n\nWhat's new since v2.0.4\n- Add verified Monad native CQL demo and record Sei hash encoding gap (7a1af66)\n- Fix Monad mainnet chain identity and CQL authority admission (c398915)\n\nFull changelog\nhttps://github.com/NextGenSoftwareUK/OASIS/commits/master/Providers/Blockchain/NextGenSoftware.OASIS.API.Providers.MonadOASIS",
